admin-notes-hidden = The machine's notes are hidden because free text may contain patient data. Each time they are shown, Analyte first records who asked and why.

admin-item-lede = What the machine accepted and what it actually did are shown separately. Times keep the machine's own spelling and time zone; when the machine leaves a time out, the earlier one is kept. Messages marked as rejected were not applied.

