admin-keeping-lede = How long Analyte keeps received messages, and holds that keep chosen data until someone releases them.

admin-holds-text = A hold keeps data from clean-up until someone releases it; it never expires. Holding an order also keeps its messages. When Analyte is not sure what belongs together, it keeps more.

